     "id": "218fa243",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"wrap section section--flush-top\" data-el=\"partners.sections\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:300px\" data-stagger>\n    <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h2 class=\"h3\">Why partner</h2><p>AFSV VRC’s model depends on aligned partners across municipalities, education, sport, inclusion, technology, corporate sponsorship, community development and capital.</p></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h2 class=\"h3\">Partnership categories</h2><p>Six audience routes cover sponsorship, education and community, technology, service and in-kind contribution, development and infrastructure, and investor inquiry.</p></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h2 class=\"h3\">Outcome sponsorship</h2><p>Sponsorship structured around measurable participation, learning and inclusion outcomes. Values and packages are administrator-configurable and not published until approved.</p></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h2 class=\"h3\">Development partnerships</h2><p>Site, design, construction, technology and operating partnerships connected to the proposed Whitby pilot.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
